EastSun 1004 (second time): 請將In/Out Arm的Z軸校正欄Show出來，目前還是沒出現.

1554472 decided the single-picker remap from HT9045System.read('gerneral'). Opened standalone it worked; inside
background.html the Teach iframe loads at HMI start and the teach-access binding ran before
ht9045_recipe_client.js had defined HT9045System, so teachOnePicker became false (= no remap) and the groups were
hidden as before. Now, if HT9045System is not there yet and the page is still loading, wait for window load and
decide then.

Checked headless with every WebSocket blocked (nothing reaches wb_serve; oplog shows only STREAM lines):
background.html?mode=debug&machine=HT9050 -> openWin('teach') -> onePicker=true, grpInArmPick / grpInArmPlace /
pnlLoader_Pick / pnlHP_Pick / SetEditPickLoader / SetButtonPick1 no longer carry teach-axis-hidden (before the
fix: all hidden, onePicker=false). Standalone page: all shown, Go hint MInArmZA.
